                    coach_intro:            `You have one 8-week cycle and €6M on the table. Three things have to be true at once: digital and sustainable value reinforce each other so sustainability becomes revenue and moat, not cost; generative AI earns its €45K a month on a job customers actually pay for; and you own a defensible place in the smart-city ecosystem before the super-app does. Don't pitch a consumer app, a city-SaaS and a platform all at once — with €6M and 24 months you can build one of these well. Which one, and why now?`,

                    runway_label:           `Runway`,
